  "text": "## Template 9: Password Reset Confirmation  \n**Subject:** Your Password Has Been Reset Successfully  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nYour online banking password has been successfully reset.\n\nImportant Security Notes:\n✓ Your new password is now active\n✓ Your old password no longer works\n✓ Log in at www.firstuk.bank/login with your new password\n✓ Never share your password with anyone\n\nIf You Didn't Request This:\nIf you didn't reset your password, contact us immediately:\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265 (24/7)\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank\n\nSecurity Reminder:\n- Use a strong password (mix of letters, numbers, symbols)\n- Change your password every 6 months\n- Never reuse old passwords\n- Log out after each session\n\nThank you,\nFirstUK Bank Security Team\n```  \n---",
